There are many sound effects in Nethack along with items that work off 
sound like a magic whistle, magic flutes and harps. Deaf animals like 
puddings, fungi and the like wouldn't be affected by these items. Also 
there are the noises of "You hear a sceptre pounded in judgement" among 
many others.

What could cause deafness? Getting caught in a landmine blast, the death 
explosion of a gas spore, perhaps a 1/10 chance of deafness from a drum of 
earthquake or using a cursed instrument. Deafness would also affect playing 
the right tune for the castle. One of the benefits would be avoiding being 
spammed by the combat messages upon donning a ring of conflict near a 
monster-packed room like throne room or zoo.

Of course the status might be considered too minor for inclusion.

